{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4febc688b947685a92caf417425b3a1d6f8670aa8de53b5b8a712a2a824842c4", "ja": "次の公演のセンターに選ばれた奈緒。\nアイドルらしいトークのために、と特訓した\n『東京弁』を披露するが上手くいかない。\nしかし、大事なのはいつもの自分だと気づき\n関西弁のままで見事に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "奈绪被选为下次公演的Center。\n她为了让讲话更有偶像的感觉，而特别练习\n『东京腔』，却无法在大家面前流畅地表达。\n然而，她察觉最重要的是展现平常的自己后，\n用原本的关西腔顺利完成了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "c0b260c5e7d10a3d71fd72f050bf503741ea82e3a965f1c2fd3de4e0707df33a", "ja": "はぁ～……こないだのライブ、\nメッチャ楽しかったわ～。", "zh": "呼啊～前阵子的演唱会，\n真的好开心呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a99352c64426428b7099ae6814367783941e6f6a539556ea7f347b1611a9da9", "ja": "わかる！　ステージが\nキラキラしてて、\n興奮するっていうか……。", "zh": "我懂！\n舞台整个都闪闪发亮，\n该说是让人感觉很兴奋吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "bfce46bf13b7e2189efabe46b7ed05157b57657204658c599d8c1c860711d8a1", "ja": "なんかもうとにかく、\nサイコー！って叫びたくなるよね！", "zh": "总之就是会想大喊：\n「超赞──！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "8b4f42ae66c0c8ebe5e617287de8e3eee5eb05a954ce4edb93c96bae8e17390f", "ja": "今でもこんなに楽しいんやから、\nセンターとかやったら、\nもっと楽しいんやろな～。", "zh": "我到现在都还觉得意犹未尽，\n如果能当Center，\n一定会更开心吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "8f0348b52fc1ac3370c401b3b79d3f146559eb01708cab79a35c6208acdbfa66", "ja": "な、美奈子もセンター、\n楽しかったやろ？", "zh": "对了，美奈子当Center\n也很开心吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "757b8857b1bf38758e47bb9793fc5b2c409f9660cf9b41ae0aec652815e9bf88", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。センター\nならではの楽しさ、\nみたいなのは、確かにあったかも♪", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n当Center的确能感受到\n一种特别的乐趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "857ec93316c0345e5b668e2708e1aeddf9c9e5a5031aa1369f385a0639b1410a", "ja": "やっぱそうなんや～。\n美奈子、ええな～。", "zh": "果然是这样呀～\n好羡慕美奈子喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "2fbd6780eb7682c93491e797648b8d9f3f8444203b0f88476c9a807a1cd67836", "ja": "客席いーっぱいのお客さんが、\n私に向かって\n手を振ってくれる……。", "zh": "观众席上坐了好多好多客人，\n然后他们全都对我挥手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_011_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "4bdf5ae0a931dbc7ba9611a25f14f9d3ab3894f55db518bbb97af1c962a8738d", "ja": "そんなん、めっちゃ\n嬉しいやろな～。\n私もいつか、見てみたいわ～！", "zh": "那样我肯定会超开心吧～\n总有一天，我也想看看那样的景色～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
